---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL, CLARITY_ID } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Privacy policy of ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: your figures stay with you`} description="What the Centrelink household calculator processes: no cookie, no account, no income or family details kept by the publisher. Your rights under the GDPR and the Australian Privacy Act." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers {SITE_URL}. Estimating Centrelink payments means describing your family, your earnings, your rent and your savings, which is exactly the information that should not travel. The calculators were written to run entirely in your browser. The publisher is established in France, so the EU General Data Protection Regulation applies to everything the site does; visitors in Australia also keep the protections of the Privacy Act 1988 and the Australian Privacy Principles, including the right to know how to contact us.</p>
    <p>This site sets no cookie, and the calculators store nothing on your device.</p>
    <h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>2. What never leaves your browser</h2>
    <p>Relationship status, children's ages, income, rent, assets, savings and payment type are processed by code running on your own device and are never sent to us, to Services Australia or to anyone else. The "copy share link" button writes your answers into the page address so you can send a calculation to a financial counsellor or a relative; anyone who receives that link can read them.</p>
    <h2>3. What is processed</h2>
    <h3>Hosting logs</h3><p>Like every web host, GitHub records the IP address, time, requested page and browser type of each request to keep the service secure. Legal basis: legitimate interest. Retention follows GitHub's policy.</p>
    {CLARITY_ID
      ? <><h3>Anonymous stability monitoring, without cookies</h3><p>To find broken pages, the site loads Microsoft Clarity (Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, Dublin) in cookie-free mode: errors, load times, dead clicks and scrolling are measured per page view, without cookies and without linking visits, and page content and everything typed are masked. Microsoft receives the technical data of the request, including the IP address. Legal basis: legitimate interest in a working site (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR). You can object by blocking clarity.ms or by writing to us.</p></>
      : <><h3>No analytics</h3><p>No audience measurement, advertising or social media tool runs on this site today. If a stability monitoring tool is added, this page will name it and describe what it records before it is switched on.</p></>}
    <h3>Emails</h3><p>If you write to us, we keep your address and message to reply, and delete them three years after the last exchange. Please do not send your Customer Reference Number, tax file number or copies of letters: the amount in question and your situation are enough.</p>
    <h2>4. No sale, no profiling</h2><p>We do not sell or rent personal information, do not use it for advertising and do not build profiles.</p>
    <h2>5. Recipients and transfers</h2><p>The host, GitHub, Inc., is in the United States; request data may be processed there under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
    <h2>6. Your rights</h2><p>You may ask for access, correction or deletion, restrict or object to processing, by writing to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>; we answer within one month. You may complain to the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority} (<a href={LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl}</a>) or, in Australia, to the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner.</p>
    <h2>7. Children</h2><p>The site is meant for adults managing a household budget and collects nothing from children.</p>
    <p>See also the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a> and the <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
